function topologicalSortDFS(graph):
    visited = set()
    result_stack = stack() // or list to prepend

    function dfs(u):
        visited.add(u)
        for v in graph.adj[u]:
            if v not in visited:
                dfs(v)
        result_stack.push(u) // Add to stack AFTER all descendants visited

    for u in graph.vertices:
        if u not in visited:
            dfs(u)

    return result_stack.pop_all_in_order() // or reverse the list
```
The final topological order is obtained by popping elements from `result_stack` or reversing the list if appending.

